cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "LLM API pricing dataset"
abstract: >-
  Prices of current large language model APIs as published by their makers,
  each with the day it was last verified and the maker's page it was read
  from, plus a dated record of every change to those prices. The data behind
  the LLM API pricing table of AI Signal (https://aisignalhq.com/api-pricing/).
authors:
